&lt;p&gt;Hudson River Trading (HRT) is seeking a Crypto Business Operations Manager to join our Digital Assets team in Singapore. In this role, you will support the day-to-day operations of our digital assets business and help scale critical business functions across platform management, data integrity, project management, treasury processes, and operational execution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an eager learner with a strong interest in automated trading, cryptocurrencies, digital assets, and financial markets, along with excellent judgment and the ability to navigate a fast-paced environment while solving complex operational problems. In this role, you will be immersed in the ever-changing financial markets, solve problems in an extremely fast-paced, real-time environment, and serve as the primary liaison between HRT and its counterparties.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage business operations of HRT’s digital assets trading business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain relationships with exchanges, platforms, and other external counterparties&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with accounting, operations, and platform teams to resolve operational challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Research and evaluate new markets for potential trading opportunities and work with traders and developers to implement new markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and manage marketplace changes, including technical, product, pricing, and legal developments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with developers and infrastructure on continued performance optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse oneself in the marketplace in order to deal with the idiosyncrasies of the market and how they affect HRT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant work experience in business operations, financial operations, markets, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interest in digital assets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills (Unix, Python, and SQL) are a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of trading and exchanges required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of trading systems, risk, hedging, forks, proof-of-work vs. proof-of-stake, and other trading and digital assets-related features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and oral communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong work ethic and desire to see complex projects through from concept to completion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
