&lt;li&gt;Enable and promote good engineering practice across the Enterprise Technology organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop monitoring solutions to ensure high system uptime and reliability; utilize tools to detect and resolve issues proactively&lt;/li&gt;
