&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing networked storage with NetApp appliances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with troubleshooting NFS and SMB on Linux and Windows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in site reliability engineering or related disciplines&lt;/li&gt;
